    "Description": "Copy of a letter to Mrs. William W. Farley from Peter B. Sandbeck, Restoration Specialist at the North Carolina Department of Cultural Resources. Letter was sent on August 31, 1977, and discusses the approval to have Durward Center restore the Wurlitzer 125 band organ for the Pullen Park Carousel. Signed by Peter B. Sandbeck. There are several annotations made by Cy Farley, including \"Finally!\" written at the top, and \"If you can make - it - call me Tues. A.M. --Thanks, Cy\" written at the bottom, along with \"Ann sending a copy to Royster.\" ",
